{
  "id": "cascading-failure",
  "title": "Payment rollout cascades into checkout",
  "kind": "positive",
  "description": "payment-service 2.3.0 is deployed; its refund handler throws, payment errors reach 60% and checkout fails on the payment step. The alert is on checkout; the cause is one hop away.",
